---
title: "pkce_verification (stem-system: PKCE Code Challenge Verification)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_method: method == S256?
    q_check_method --> q_not_s256: method != S256
    q_check_method --> q_hash: method == S256
    q_not_s256 --> [*]: return false
    q_hash --> q_compute: sha256(verifier).digest(base64url)
    q_compute --> q_compare: computed_hash == challenge?
    q_compare --> q_match: equal
    q_compare --> q_no_match: not equal
    q_match --> [*]: return true
    q_no_match --> [*]: return false

    note right of q_hash
        INV-001: only S256 method is supported (plain is rejected)
        INV-002: uses crypto.createHash('sha256') with base64url encoding
    end note
